                <pb facs="0228" n="158" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv01/pg158"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 G 861/178a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Special Representative</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">House</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-13T12:00:00-05:00"
                            >November 13, 1918—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>33. For Grew. After consultation with the
                    President you are selected to act as Secretary of the United States Commission
                    to the Peace Conference. Your assistant secretaries will be Harrison and Patchin. Cable at once any suggestions which you may have as to
                    needs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
